From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 09:53:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] wininet: per-site cookie decisions, proxy bypass list, global
 HTTP version and connected state (3002)

InternetSet/Get/Enum PerSiteCookieDecision (A and W) and
InternetClearAllPerSiteCookieDecisions keep the decisions below the user's
Internet Settings (P3P\History, one key per site): COOKIE_STATE_UNKNOWN forgets
a site, enumeration reports ERROR_NO_MORE_ITEMS at the end and
ERROR_INSUFFICIENT_BUFFER with the needed size for a short buffer.
IsHostInProxyBypassList matches a host against the process-wide ProxyOverride
list with the matcher requests use (wildcards, <local>); requests apply the
same function. INTERNET_OPTION_HTTP_VERSION is stored and used for new
requests without an explicit version; INTERNET_OPTION_CONNECTED_STATE is stored
and read back. InternetCheckConnection with no URL asks whether there is a
connection. InternetAutodial, InternetAutodialHangup, InternetConfirmZoneCrossing
and DllInstall no longer log a FIXME for returning what they should.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

diff --git a/dlls/wininet/cookie.c b/dlls/wininet/cookie.c
index bd9bd06..3f8baba 100644
--- a/dlls/wininet/cookie.c
+++ b/dlls/wininet/cookie.c
@@ -34,6 +34,7 @@
 #include "wininet.h"
 #include "lmcons.h"
 #include "winerror.h"
